description	"The Jet Trooper - Rocketeer

A special trooper covered in thick, magnetically plated armor. His jetpack is such that he can remain in the air for extended periods of time. He can be very difficult for a jedi to kill. This one carries a rocket launcher instead of a repeating rifle.

^2Weaponry:
- PLX-1 Rocket Launcher (6 Rockets)
-- Pulse Warheads
- Clone Pistol (2)

^8Attributes:
- Magnetic Plating
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack [No Fuel Use / Cooldown]

^2Strengths^7: Well armored, Mobile, formidable against Droid Classes, and can fly for indefinite periods.
^1Weaknesses^7: Limited ammunition capacity without ammo dispensers, relies on mobility as a source of defense."